[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
pkg(8) loads only plugins that are explicitly enabled.  To activate
pkg-be-plugin, add the following line to %%PREFIX%%/etc/pkg.conf:

	PLUGINS [ "be" ];

The plugin works without a configuration file; all keys have built-in
defaults.  To customize, copy %%PREFIX%%/etc/pkg/be.conf.sample to
%%PREFIX%%/etc/pkg/be.conf and edit it.

See pkg-be-plugin(8) for details.
EOM
}
]
